{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Breaking: Dino Breach</strong> is an <strong>isometric survival horror</strong> inspired by <i><strong>Dino Crisis.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With gameplay that echoes the intense <strong>survival</strong> dynamics and <strong>tension</strong> of the classic <i>Dino Crisis</i>, <strong>Time Breaking: Dino Breach</strong> offers a mix of action, puzzle-solving and moments of pure suspense as you explore\u00a0<strong>claustrophobic research centers </strong> and <strong>prehistoric jungles</strong>\u00a0populated by deadly <strong>dinosaurs</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407680/extras/bfd72a6ecebe14f1b4f16f6591a2e6a9.avif?t=1770484152\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407680/extras_big/bfd72a6ecebe14f1b4f16f6591a2e6a9.avif?t=1770484152 width=800 height=450 /></span>  Key Gameplay Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live a gripping and emotional story</strong>: Step into the role of Kate Jeong, a R.O.P.E soldier who travels back in time to change the tragic fate of Alan, a person she deeply loves.\u00a0But what will be the consequences of her choices?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore dangerous environments</strong>: Navigate hostile prehistoric jungles and claustrophobic research centers in search of resources, weapons, and key items that can mean the difference between life and death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face deadly dinosaurs</strong>: Engage in tense and fear-filled battles with dangerous dinosaurs whose behaviors are inspired by those found in <i>Dino Crisis</i>. Use your wits and carefully manage limited ammunition to defeat or escape them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve puzzles and riddles</strong>: Solve puzzles and environmental riddles to progress, unlock weapon upgrades, and find useful tools to survive the ravenous dinosaurs.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3407680?t=1770484152","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407680/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770484152","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407680/680d28d622c4f7522ba84220f1ecc574929ea25c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770484152","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407680/680d28d622c4f7522ba84220f1ecc574929ea25c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770484152","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains scenes of explicit violence and gore."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3407690,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Breaking: Dino Breach</strong> is an <strong>isometric survival horror</strong> inspired by <i><strong>Dino Crisis.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With gameplay that echoes the intense <strong>survival</strong> dynamics and <strong>tension</strong> of the classic <i>Dino Crisis</i>, <strong>Time Breaking: Dino Breach</strong> offers a mix of action, puzzle-solving and moments of pure suspense as you explore\u00a0<strong>claustrophobic research centers </strong> and <strong>prehistoric jungles</strong>\u00a0populated by deadly <strong>dinosaurs</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407680/extras/bfd72a6ecebe14f1b4f16f6591a2e6a9.avif?t=1770484152\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407680/extras_big/bfd72a6ecebe14f1b4f16f6591a2e6